Rāvaṇa demands war or surrender from kings --- Duṣyanta Suratha Gādhi Gayā Purūravas yield --- Rāvaṇa challenges Anaraṇya at guarded Ayōdhyā --- Anaraṇya leads vast host to duel --- Rāvaṇa burns host like oblation --- Anaraṇya looses eight hundred arrows harmlessly --- Rāvaṇa fells king with palm stroke --- Dying Anaraṇya curses Ikṣvāku-born killer and ascends
